    "name": "Raccoon on a boat",
    "steam_appid": 3073700,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073700/extras/4569dcc2348b2a76b80d4d5b19cda688.avif?t=1733131892\" width=640 height=352 /></span><br><br>Raccoon on a Boat is the best ecological park in the region.<br>Many creatures live in a pristine environment.<br><br>Although hands-on learning and photography are by appointment only,<br>You are the exception.<br>Because you are one of a kind. <br>Hop on a boat today.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073700/extras/fd6ee1a130cb333858b35ce73e7566ca.avif?t=1733131892\" width=500 height=375 /></span><br><br>Explore the valley by boat, splashing through rapids and navigating through lush forests.<br>And snap a photo of a nocturnal raccoon.<br>If you see something strange, snap a photo.<br>Remember these moments forever.<br><br>Who are you, on a boat in the middle of the night, exploring an ecological park?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073700/extras/71e32a22d78987ee435f3f72f2241eb0.avif?t=1733131892\" width=500 height=320 /></span><br><br>When all is said and done, you'll have a comic book that tells the story behind &quot;Raccoon on a Boat.<br>What was going on in this place?<br><br>Lanterns and bugs, darkness and water, something wild awaits you.<br><br>If you don't manage to capture them all in one trip, you can always try again.<br>Will you be able to find all the raccoons?",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073700/extras/4569dcc2348b2a76b80d4d5b19cda688.avif?t=1733131892\" width=640 height=352 /></span><br><br>Raccoon on a Boat is the best ecological park in the region.<br>Many creatures live in a pristine environment.<br><br>Although hands-on learning and photography are by appointment only,<br>You are the exception.<br>Because you are one of a kind. <br>Hop on a boat today.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073700/extras/fd6ee1a130cb333858b35ce73e7566ca.avif?t=1733131892\" width=500 height=375 /></span><br><br>Explore the valley by boat, splashing through rapids and navigating through lush forests.<br>And snap a photo of a nocturnal raccoon.<br>If you see something strange, snap a photo.<br>Remember these moments forever.<br><br>Who are you, on a boat in the middle of the night, exploring an ecological park?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073700/extras/71e32a22d78987ee435f3f72f2241eb0.avif?t=1733131892\" width=500 height=320 /></span><br><br>When all is said and done, you'll have a comic book that tells the story behind &quot;Raccoon on a Boat.<br>What was going on in this place?<br><br>Lanterns and bugs, darkness and water, something wild awaits you.<br><br>If you don't manage to capture them all in one trip, you can always try again.<br>Will you be able to find all the raccoons?",
